     compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-1988 (“POSIX.1”) specification.

     The ttccddrraaiinn() function is expected to be compliant with IEEE Std
     1003.1-1988 (“POSIX.1”) when the drain wait value is set to zero with
     comcontrol(8), or with ioctl(2) _T_I_O_C_S_D_R_A_I_N_W_A_I_T, or with sysctl(8)
     _k_e_r_n_._t_t_y___d_r_a_i_n_w_a_i_t.  A non-zero drain wait value can result in ttccddrraaiinn()
